OL,3,ABayeux tour to include audio account of
OL,4,Atapestry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Museum will provide an
OL,7,Faudio-described tour of the Bayeux
OL,8,FTapestry after a man with visual
OL,9,Fimpairment pointed out the lack of
OL,10,Faccess for blind and partially-sighted
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FDr Yusuf Ali Osman, from Croydon, said
OL,14,Fthe museum breached the Equality Act by
OL,15,Fnot offering such tours of the
OL,16,Fexhibition.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, the central London museum
OL,19,Fsaid an in-person audio-described tour
OL,20,Fwould be held during the exhibition's
OL,21,Frun.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
